		<RichText x="66" y="666" width="508" height="212" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">雕刻师使用1枚冰块，在<span color="#ffdfbf">5s</span><span>后将其雕刻成巨口霜精，霜精每隔一段时间发射雪球造成巨额伤害；之后每</span><span color="#ffdfbf">约15s</span><span>，丘林都会使用冰块进行雕刻。<br/>巨口霜精具有</span><span color="#99ffff">120冻</span><span>盾，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">40s</span><span>后自行消失；受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，正在雕刻中的冰块会立即变成无害的小动物，其具有</span><span color="#99ffff">3冻</span><span>盾，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">12s</span><span>后自行消失。<br/></span><span color="#bfffbf">(N4) </span><span>丘林将在开局进行雕刻，且使用</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2</span><span>枚冰块。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>丘林开局不立即进行雕刻，但丘林同样会使用</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2</span><span>枚冰块，同时雕刻冰块的时长延长至</span><span color="#ffdfbf">6.3s</span><span>。雕刻出的巨口霜精</span><span color="#ffdfbf">20s</span><span>后自行消失，且场上的霜精不会超过2枚。<br/>当冰块受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响时会立即爆炸，每个对丘林自己造成</span><span color="#ffdfbf">固定的499999</span><span>伤害，同时降低其</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%风抗与20%其余抗性</span><span>，减抗效果可叠加最多</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3</span><span>层；若</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s</span><span>内没有再次触发减抗效果，则移除所有减抗效果。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
