		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/烁煌之役-历经百战的矮灵雕刻师%B7运风成斤.assets/Image_20.png')" x="1006" y="847" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1538" y="320" width="430" height="43" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="18" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">丘林在玩家头顶凝出九枚冰锥，冰锥呈十字排列，并同时下砸，造成<span color="#99ffff">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1538" y="768" width="426" height="65" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="18" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">丘林召唤<span color="#ffdfbf">2</span><span>块冰进行雕刻，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">6.3s</span><span>后凝成「</span><span textDecoration="underline">巨口霜精</span><span>」，发射雪球，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">120%</span><span>伤害。</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>会使冰块爆炸，对丘林造成伤害并减少风元素抗性与其他抗性。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/烁煌之役-历经百战的矮灵雕刻师%B7运风成斤.assets/Image_21.png')" x="1519" y="234">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/烁煌之役-历经百战的矮灵雕刻师%B7运风成斤.assets/Image_22.png')" x="1519" y="681">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1538" y="544" width="443" height="65" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="18" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">丘林在玩家处召唤3枚大风涡，持续牵引玩家并造成<span color="#ffff99">10%</span><span>的</span><span color="#99ffff">冰元素</span><span>与</span><span color="#7fffd7">风元素</span><span>伤害。场地上存在3枚风涡时，只会召唤1枚风涡。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
